import interface.dl
import ../input.dl

to read spatial input from {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    close a game from view
    if view's input kind = 9:
        if view's key press is one of [the UI P key, the UI R key]:
            set view's key press to -1
        return nothing
    if view's input kind != 3:
        return nothing
    set session to the spatial study in (view's instance)
    if view's key press = the UI P key:
        set session's paused to not session's paused
    if view's key press = the UI R key:
        restart session
    if view's key press is one of [the UI P key, the UI R key]:
        set view's damaged to true
        set view's key press to -1

to advance the spatial frame in {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set session to the spatial study in (view's instance)
    set forward, sideways, vertical and turn to 0.0
    if key (the UI W key) is held in view:
        add 1.0 to forward
    if key (the UI S key) is held in view:
        subtract 1.0 from forward
    if key (the UI D key) is held in view:
        add 1.0 to sideways
    if key (the UI A key) is held in view:
        subtract 1.0 from sideways
    if key (the UI E key) is held in view:
        add 1.0 to vertical
    if key (the UI Q key) is held in view:
        subtract 1.0 from vertical
    if key (the UI left arrow key) is held in view:
        add 1.0 to turn
    if key (the UI right arrow key) is held in view:
        subtract 1.0 from turn
    move session forward forward sideways sideways vertically vertical turning turn after (view's frame seconds) seconds
    set status to "EXPLORING"
    if session's paused:
        set status to "PAUSED"
    else:
        animate UI view view
    set the text of "View status" in (view's instance) to status

to explore {a pointer to spatial session:session} named {C string:name} in {UI reference:description}:
    set interface to an instance of description with state session
    set view to a desktop view of (the address of interface) sized 1280 by 780 using fonts "assets/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "assets/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf"
    set the text of "Scene name" in (the address of interface) to name
    watch UI input in (the address of view) using (the function named "read spatial input from $")
    update UI frames in (the address of view) using (the function named "advance the spatial frame in $")
    run the address of view
    close the address of view
    close the address of interface
